      "title": "ieee80211: use updated fcs_len when computing frame duration",
      "message": "ieee80211: use updated fcs_len when computing frame duration\n\nieee80211-radiotap properly updates the fcs_len in the ieee_802_11_phdr\nbased on configuration and radiotap flags. Use this updated value in\nieee80211-radio.\n\nThis fixes the computed \"Duration\" value when the FCS is not included in\nthe captured frame.\n",
